{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Ensnared","html":"<article id='sn1.67'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Saṁyutta Nikāya 1.67 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Linked Discourses 1.67 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>7. Addhavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>7. Overcome </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Uḍḍitasutta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Ensnared </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Kenassu uḍḍito loko, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>“By what is the world ensnared? </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>kenassu parivārito; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>By what is it surrounded? </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Kenassu pihito loko, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>By what is the world fastened shut? </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>kismiṁ loko patiṭṭhito”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>On what is the world grounded?” </span></span></p>\n<p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Taṇhāya uḍḍito loko, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>“Craving has ensnared the world. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>jarāya parivārito; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>It’s surrounded by old age. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Maccunā pihito loko, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The world is fastened shut by mortality. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>dukkhe loko patiṭṭhito”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The world is grounded on suffering.” </span></span></p></blockquote></article>"}
